            and customized solar proposal in Karur</strong>. Call us at +91 90000 00000 or message us on WhatsApp
            for an instant quote. Join 1,200+ happy customers across Tamil Nadu who have saved millions with
            Frontline Solar.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <Footer client:visible />
  </main>
